      "caption": "Treble splits system.img from vendor.img and defines a stable interface between them.",
      "narration": "Treble splits the image into system and vendor. The framework only talks to vendor code through versioned interfaces, so each side can change independently.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "The split",
